{:edb/committed true :edb/basis-t 1241 :edb/replayed false :edb/tx-hash "922e670906ed1e7f705d71f8a51b7aab8e5afccb3b694ccb3e011e8bfd815011" :edb/db-before-t 1240 :edb/db-after-t 1241 :edb/tx-data [[13194139534553 50 #inst "2026-10-08T00:48:41.991Z" 13194139534553 true] [17592186059481 1100 "Calculate $\\det(A)$, if $\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 2 \\\\ 5 & 6\\end{bmatrix}$" 13194139534553 false] [17592186059481 1100 "Calculate $\\det(A),$ if $[\\begin{aligned}3 & 2 \\\\ 5 & 6\\end{aligned}]$" 13194139534553 true] [17592186059481 1145 "For a $2 \\times 2$ matrix, the determinant is given by the formula\n\n$$\n\\begin{vmatrix}a & b \\\\ c & d\\end{vmatrix}\n$$\n\nUsing the formula, we have:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\ndet(A) &= \\begin{vmatrix}3 & 2 \\\\ 5 & 6\\end{vmatrix} \\\\\n&= 3 \\cdot 6 - 2 \\cdot 5 \\\\\n&= 18 - 10 \\\\\n&= 8\n\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534553 false] [17592186059481 1145 "For a $2 \\times 2$ matrix, the determinant is given by the formula\n\n$$\n|\\begin{aligned}a & b \\\\ c & d\\end{aligned}|\n$$\n\nUsing the formula, we have:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(A) & =|\\begin{aligned}3 & 2 \\\\ 5 & 6\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =3\\cdot 6-2\\cdot 5 \\\\  & =18-10 \\\\  & =8\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534553 true] [17592186059482 1100 "Calculate $\\det(A)$, if $\\begin{bmatrix}\\sqrt{2} & -2 \\\\ 0 & \\sqrt{3}\\end{bmatrix}$" 13194139534553 false] [17592186059482 1100 "Calculate $\\det(A),$ if $[\\begin{aligned}\\sqrt{2} & -2 \\\\ 0 & \\sqrt{3}\\end{aligned}]$" 13194139534553 true] [17592186059482 1145 "For a $2 \\times 2$ matrix, the determinant is given by the formula\n\n$$\n\\begin{vmatrix}a & b \\\\ c & d\\end{vmatrix}\n$$\n\nUsing the formula, we have:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\ndet(A) &= \\begin{vmatrix}\\sqrt{2} & -2 \\\\ 0 & \\sqrt{3}\\end{vmatrix} \\\\\n&= \\sqrt{2} \\cdot \\sqrt{3} - (-2) \\cdot 0 \\\\\n&= \\sqrt{6}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534553 false] [17592186059482 1145 "For a $2 \\times 2$ matrix, the determinant is given by the formula\n\n$$\n|\\begin{aligned}a & b \\\\ c & d\\end{aligned}|\n$$\n\nUsing the formula, we have:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(A) & =|\\begin{aligned}\\sqrt{2} & -2 \\\\ 0 & \\sqrt{3}\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =\\sqrt{2}\\cdot \\sqrt{3}-(-2)\\cdot 0 \\\\  & =\\sqrt{6}\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534553 true] [17592186059483 1100 "If\n${A} = \n    \\left\\lbrack\n    \\matrix {\n        2 & -1 \\\n        -3 & k\n    }\n    \\right\\rbrack$\nand\n$\\det({A}) = 5$, what is the value of $k?$" 13194139534553 true] [17592186059483 1100 "If\n${A} = \\left\\lbrack \\matrix {2 & -1 \\ -3 & k} \\right\\rbrack$\nand\n$\\det({A}) = 5$, what is the value of $k$?" 13194139534553 false] [17592186059483 1145 "For a $2 \\times 2$ matrix, the determinant is given by the formula\n\n$$\n\\begin{vmatrix}a & b \\\\ c & d\\end{vmatrix}\n$$\n\nUsing the formula, we have:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\ndet(A) &= \\begin{vmatrix}2 & -1 \\\\ -3 & k\\end{vmatrix} \\\\\n&= 2 \\cdot k - (-1) \\cdot (-3) \\\\\n&= 2k - 3\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince $\\det(A)=5$, we obtain:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\ndet(A) &= 5 \\\\\n2k - 3 &= 5 \\\\\n2k &= 8 \\\\\nk &= 4\n\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534553 false] [17592186059483 1145 "For a $2 \\times 2$ matrix, the determinant is given by the formula\n\n$$\n|\\begin{aligned}a & b \\\\ c & d\\end{aligned}|\n$$\n\nUsing the formula, we have:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(A) & =|\\begin{aligned}2 & -1 \\\\ -3 & k\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =2\\cdot k-(-1)\\cdot (-3) \\\\  & =2k-3\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince $\\det(A)=5,$ we obtain:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(A) & =5 \\\\ 2k-3 & =5 \\\\ 2k & =8 \\\\ k & =4\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534553 true] [17592186059673 1020 #edb/ref 17592186295041 13194139534553 true] [17592186059673 1020 #edb/ref 17592186295062 13194139534553 true] [17592186059674 1020 #edb/ref 17592186295027 13194139534553 true] [17592186059674 1020 #edb/ref 17592186295034 13194139534553 true] [17592186059674 1020 #edb/ref 17592186295076 13194139534553 true] [17592186059675 1020 #edb/ref 1759218